assistant: Let me also check if there's a separate returns policy with timeline info.
tool_call: {"query": "return window eligibility requirements"}
tool_result: {"ok": true, "results": [{"policy_id": "cw-refunds", "score": 2.295, "snippet": "# Cartwheel refund policy\n\nApproved refunds go back to the original payment method and arrive in 5 to 10 business days. Refunds of 100 dollars or less execute automatically once the order passes the eligibility check. Refunds above 100 dollars are queued for review by a human support agent before an", "title": "Cartwheel refund policy"}, {"policy_id": "cw-returns", "score": 1.757, "snippet": "# Cartwheel return policy\n\nItems bought on Cartwheel can be returned within 30 days of delivery. The window counts from the delivery date, not the purchase date. Items must be in the condition described by the store's listing. Individual stores may override this window; see the store overrides polic", "title": "Cartwheel return policy"}, {"policy_id": "store-cascade-audio-policy", "score": 1.385, "snippet": "# Cascade Audio store policy\n\nCascade Audio follows the Cartwheel platform return window of 30 days from delivery. Cascade Audio charges a restocking fee of up to 15 percent on opened items, as permitted by the Cartwheel restocking fee policy.", "title": "Cascade Audio store policy"}]}
tool_call: {"policy_id": "cw-returns"}
tool_result: {"audience": "all", "body": "# Cartwheel return policy\n\nItems bought on Cartwheel can be returned within 30 days of delivery. The window counts from the delivery date, not the purchase date. Items must be in the condition described by the store's listing. Individual stores may override this window; see the store overrides policy and the store's own policy page.", "ok": true, "policy_id": "cw-returns", "title": "Cartwheel return policy"}
assistant: Here's a clear summary you can share with your customer:

### Returns (policy **cw-returns**)
- Customers have **30 days from the delivery date** (not the purchase date) to return an item.
- The item must be in the condition described in your store listing.
- Note: As a merchant, you can set your own return-window override if needed—check your store policy page for that.

### Refunds (policy **cw-refunds**)
- Once a return is approved and the order passes the eligibility check:
  - **$100 or less** → refund is processed **automatically**.
  - **Over $100** → refund is queued for **human review** before any money moves.
- Approved refunds go back to the **original payment method** and typically arrive in **5–10 business days**.

One extra thing worth knowing: any refunds issued during the week are **deducted from your next Friday payout** (policy **cw-payouts**).

Let me know if you need anything else!

