### Refund Details *(cw-refunds)*
- Approved refunds go back to the **original payment method** — not store credit.
- Refunds typically arrive in **5–10 business days**.
- Refunds of **$100 or less** are processed automatically once the order passes the eligibility check.
- Refunds **over $100** are queued for review by a human support agent before any money is issued.

